<BODY BGCOLOR="#000000" TEXT="#FFFFFF" LINK="#90FFFF" VLINK="#CCCCCC">
<FONT FACE="Arial,Helvetica">

<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">

<!--//

   if (document.images) {

      // Load images needed [BACK] button.

      back_on  = new Image(); back_on.src  = "../../buttons/back_on.gif";  
      back_off = new Image(); back_off.src = "../../buttons/back.gif";  
   }

   function TurnOn() {

      // Displays image and updates status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_on.src;
         window.status = 'Go back to previous page';
      }
   }

   function TurnOff() {

      // Displays image and clears status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_off.src;
         window.status = '';
      }
   }

//-->

</SCRIPT>

<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:sf.wside@virgin.net">Steve Whiteside</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

        Steve's white Tipo 5 door 16V registered in 1992 has covered
        130,000 miles. Steve says the car
        still slips along at crazy speeds, guzzlin the gas at an alarming
        rate. Apart from this, the car is superb, its fast, sturdy and
        sticks to the road with a magnetic certainty.
        It has been
        serviced by Fiat which makes that all the more remarkable. The car
        has been lovingly looked after with nothing but original FIAT
        parts.
        <P>
        Other modifications will be made as parts come up for replacement.
        Steve missed out on upgrading the engine. The timing belt let ago a
        while back when it's previous owner had the beast, causing the
        need for an upper engine rebuild.


